Accept descending ordering set with Up. Reopen, disable it with another Up,
and cancel: the accepted descending stack and alpha's last-row position return.

    :k up C-s
    :snap

```terminal
session:                                                                                           ┃
  3/3 | [C-s] ↑n | [C-r] repo: none                                                                ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
 ■ runner                                                                                          ┃
 ■ beta                                                                                            ┃
▌■ alpha                                                                                           ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                                           ┃
```

